<h2 class="bde-heading-506-126 bde-heading">
How Much Is Jordan Poole Worth?
</h2><div class="bde-fancy-container-506-127 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-fancy-container-506-143 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-shortcode-506-157 bde-shortcode"><div class="nba-fin" data-nba-fin="worth">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/_ported/08ba6176394a.css">
<div class="nf-stat"><div class="nf-label">Estimated Net Worth</div><div class="nf-value">$53M</div><div class="nf-rank">Estimated from career earnings</div></div><script src="/_ported/8334868131c3.js" is:inline></script>
</div>
</div><div class="bde-f-text-506-156 bde-f-text">
<p>Poole’s net worth is estimated at around <strong>$53.24m</strong>, taken from his <strong>$133.09m</strong> in career earnings. Celebrity Net Worth publishes <strong>$15m</strong> for him, which is about a ninth of what he has been paid in salary alone.</p>
<p>He played two seasons at Michigan and Golden State took him 28th in 2019, the day after he turned 20. He won a championship there in 2022.</p>

