<script type="application/ld+json" is:inline>{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","@id":"https://nbasalaries.com/players/jordan-poole/#faq","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://nbasalaries.com/players/jordan-poole/"},"mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Is Jordan Poole Paid in 2026-27?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Poole earns $34.04m in 2026-27, second at New Orleans and the last year of his extension. It rises from $31.85m last season. His career earnings reach $133.09m across eight seasons. The salary is 17.32% of the club’s $196.53m payroll."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What’s Next for Jordan Poole Beyond 2026?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The contract ends after this season. He becomes an unrestricted free agent in the summer of 2027 at 28, young enough for another long contract."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Does Jordan Poole Earn Over Time?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A $34.04m season is hard to picture, so here's what it comes to over smaller stretches of time."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What Does Jordan Poole’s Contract With the Pelicans Include?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Poole is in the last year of a four-year extension worth $128m that he signed with Golden State in 2022 under Bird rights, of which $123m is guaranteed, with $17m of incentives attached. New Orleans has had the contract since 2025. He becomes an unrestricted free agent in 2027 at 28."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Is Jordan Poole Worth?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Poole’s net worth is estimated at around $53.24m, taken from his $133.09m in career earnings. Celebrity Net Worth publishes $15m for him, which is about a ninth of what he has been paid in salary alone. He played two seasons at Michigan and Golden State took him 28th in 2019, the day after he turned 20. He won a championship there in 2022."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why Did the Pelicans Extend Jordan Poole?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Poole is paid $34.04m because Golden State extended him at that price weeks after he had been a starter on a championship team, and the contract has followed him since. He has earned $133.09m and $123m of it comes from one contract."}}]}</script>
